        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Do your eyes feel dry, irritated, or constantly tired? Many people deal with dry eye symptoms every day, especially from screen time and allergies.</p><p>The good news is that real solutions are available. At <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Academy Vision</a>, we look beyond quick fixes to find out what’s causing your discomfort and help you feel better for the long run.</p>",
