        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Common Dry Eye Symptoms",
          "html": "Common Dry Eye Symptoms",
          "id": "feTFwCLHy3",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Dry eye doesn’t always feel the same for everyone, but it often shows up in ways like this:</p><ul><li>A burning, stinging, or scratchy feeling in your eyes</li><li>That gritty sensation—like something is stuck in your eye</li><li>Redness that doesn’t seem to go away</li><li>Watery eyes (even though they still feel dry)</li><li>Blurry or fluctuating vision throughout the day</li><li>Eyes that feel tired, especially after screen time</li></ul>",
          "id": "kyFLNQU8EB",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
