          "text": "A Better Way to Treat Dry Eye in Pine Beach",
          "html": "A Better Way to Treat Dry Eye in Pine Beach",
          "id": "n3NSWpUyEj",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>A lot of people have tried over-the-counter drops but still feel uncomfortable, because they don’t address the root of the problem. We take a different approach.</p><p>Our dry eye doctors look closely at what’s causing your dry eye, how severe it is, and what your day-to-day life looks like. From there, we build a treatment plan that’s tailored to you.</p>",
          "id": "OxHONuIc9m",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
