        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Our Dry Eye Treatment Options",
          "html": "Our Dry Eye Treatment Options",
          "id": "ys4yn81hh0",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Once we understand what’s causing your dry eye, we can recommend treatments. Your plan may include:</p><ul><li><strong>Prescription eye drops</strong> to reduce inflammation and improve tear quality</li><li><strong>Punctal plugs</strong> to help your eyes hold onto moisture longer</li><li><strong>Amniotic membranes</strong> for advanced healing of the eye’s surface</li><li><strong>Lid treatments and eyelid hygiene</strong> to clear blocked oil glands and restore comfort</li><li><strong>Scleral lenses</strong> that create a protective, hydrating layer for more severe cases</li></ul>",
          "id": "F458yEvqTA",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
